  "tK": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 13380,
   "text": "Kept as they were: Login and 404",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 3900,
   "page": "r4"
  },
  "r4brief": {
   "x": -720,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 580,
   "fill": "blue",
   "size": "m",
   "page": "r4",
   "text": "ROUND 4\n\nTwo renditions in blue only: no yellow, no brown, no stamps, no outlined boxes or decorative rules, no typewriter font.\n\nThe investigation feel comes from the blue highlighter: it sweeps across key phrases, marks the active filter and lights up search matches.\n\nEach rendition is one prototype: press Play on any artboard and the nav moves between pages. Photos: only the paintbrush pot as a small logo, and the archive box on Login.\n\nHeadlines and dates are placeholder samples."
  }
